+| `lspci -nn \| grep -iE 'vga\|3d\|display\|render'` | `03:00.0 VGA compatible controller [0300]: Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. [AMD/ATI] Rembrandt [Radeon 680M] [1002:1681] (rev 03)` |
